    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_ecology_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "D8E8EB0E6DFAC9A7",
      "text": "멋져요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_ecology_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "D8E8EC0E6DFACB5A",
      "text": "이제 둘이 똑같아졌네요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_ecology_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "C0FD605E45B104D1",
      "text": "응!\\n디자인도 파랗고 멋진 것 같아~[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_ecology_sp03_02b",
      "hash64": "9F8F73306BCAFC29",
      "text": "헤헤...\\n그러게, 똑같아졌네~[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_ecology_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "C0FD5F5E45B1031E",
      "text": "도감을 완성하려고\\n테라리움 돔을 돌아다니니까\\r\\n정말 신나는 거 있지~[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_teacher_ecology_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "C0FD625E45B10837",
      "text": "특히 주목할 만한 건 돔의 설계야!\\n고안해 낸 사람은 정말 대단한 것 같아~![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
